[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13920.87, "timestamp": "03:52:00", "text": "是啊，你知道，好事是好事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13922.87, "timestamp": "03:52:02", "text": "我们这里没有发生洪水。或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13925.189, "timestamp": "03:52:05", "text": "或许我们可以，但在城市方面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13931.189, "timestamp": "03:52:11", "text": "更重一些的东西。你能听到吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13934.63, "timestamp": "03:52:14", "text": "我的麦克风？是的，我听得很清楚。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13938.389, "timestamp": "03:52:18", "text": "我的上帝。等等，那是音频吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13940.229, "timestamp": "03:52:20", "text": "我的意思是，不是现在，而是几秒钟之后。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13947.67, "timestamp": "03:52:27", "text": "但你关掉噪音了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13950.07, "timestamp": "03:52:30", "text": "压制就像是为了某种目的之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13954.07, "timestamp": "03:52:34", "text": "因为我有一个通用的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13956.71, "timestamp": "03:52:36", "text": "即使不使用 Discord，也会对其产生影响。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13959.67, "timestamp": "03:52:39", "text": "Discord 的噪音抑制功能，如果其中一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13963.269, "timestamp": "03:52:43", "text": "我用它的时候，我的电脑会卡顿或者像那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13965.83, "timestamp": "03:52:45", "text": "声音会有明显的延迟。所以，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13968.63, "timestamp": "03:52:48", "text": "我当时就想，我当然要把它关掉，这显而易见。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13972.07, "timestamp": "03:52:52", "text": "仅有的。我会把噪声抑制功能放进去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13974.55, "timestamp": "03:52:54", "text": "呃，Discord之类的。就让它保持原样吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13977.51, "timestamp": "03:52:57", "text": "麦克风音频。"}]